      "content": "SP 81 SE            WESTON TURVILLE         CHURCH LANE                                             (north west side) 5/312                                       No.33 Pennant Cottage 11/12/79 GV                                          II Cottage.C17 timber framed with colourwashed brick infill. Thatched roof with half-hipped ends, central brick chimney, two eyebrow dormers with modern 3-light casements. 1 storey and attic, ground floor two 2-light and one 3-light casement, all modern with glazing bars. Central doorway opposite chimney stack. 1-storey thatched lean- to at each end. Exposed timbers internally. RCHM I.p.317. MON.29. Listing NGR: SP8581110572"
    }
